# 🍅 Pomodoro Timer

A clean, desktop Pomodoro timer built with Python and Tkinter, styled with the `arc` theme.

![Pomodoro](screenshot.png)

## Features

- ⏱️ 25-minute work sessions with short and long breaks
- ✅ Checkmark tracking for completed Pomodoro sessions
- 🔔 Window pops up automatically when a session ends
- 🔄 Reset button to restart the timer at any time

## How to Run

1. Make sure you have Python installed
2. Install the required library:
   ```
   pip install ttkthemes
   ```
3. Run the app:
   ```
   python pomodoro.py
   ```
   Or double-click `pomodoro.pyw` to run without the console window

## Pomodoro Technique

| Session | Duration |
|---------|----------|
| Work | 25 minutes |
| Short Break | 5 minutes |
| Long Break | 20 minutes |

After 4 work sessions, you earn a long break!

## Built With

- Python
- Tkinter
- [ttkthemes](https://github.com/RedFantom/ttkthemes) — arc theme
